    "sections": {
        "description": "Waste Disposal Theme is designed with a structured layout suitable for displaying waste management services, recycling information, collection schedules, and environmental content. The theme includes responsive page sections, customizable banners, service blocks, testimonial areas, and contact forms for organized content presentation across devices. It supports image galleries, blog layouts, call-to-action sections, and integrated navigation for improved accessibility and usability. The theme includes typography controls, color customization options, widget-ready areas, and multiple page templates to simplify content management. It is compatible with standard plugins for forms, SEO settings, and social media integration. Clean coding practices and optimized layouts help maintain consistent loading performance and browser compatibility. Additional features include footer customization, menu management, icon support, and homepage section controls. The overall design focuses on structured content display, readability, and simple navigation for waste disposal and recycling-related websites."
    },
